\par \hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 The TIFF 6.0 file format specification can be obtained by FTP from
\par \hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 ftp://ftp.sgi.com/graphics/tiff/TIFF6.ps.gz.  The JPEG incorporation scheme
\par \hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 found in the TIFF 6.0 spec of 3-June-92 has a number of serious problems.
\par \hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 IJG does not recommend use of the TIFF 6.0 design (TIFF Compression tag 6).
\par \hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 Instead, we recommend the JPEG design proposed by TIFF Te\hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 chnical Note #2
