\par \hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 from ftp://ftp.uu.net/graphics/jpeg/.  It is expected that the next revision
\par \hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 of the TIFF spec will replace the 6.0 JPEG design with the Note's design.
\par \hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 Although IJG's own code does not support TIFF/JPEG, the free libtiff library
\par \hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 uses our library to implement TIFF/JPEG per the Note.  libtiff is available
\par \hich\af1456\dbch\af31505\loch\f1456 from ftp://ftp.sgi.com/graphics/tiff/.
